8ed4c887902fb31e59da21c2267bf2314ad17f3d30465f57221a487bd0f7b83d603bbb9fb27ebbbfd2ab6ad67544935dec851ecdc231d02fb3a2bb9715a952c0  0001-pdc-add-subscription-id.patch
"
